573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T16:02:54Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T17:47:23Z","body":"I've adjusted the text to be shorter and added tooltips for instructing the user on how to change things to allow for HDR output:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"533\" height=\"203\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/173719a6-1d9a-4051-a99c-d88eaf4d3ab1\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"417\" height=\"169\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6829f0f7-a205-4668-b427-513bb4cb2b4b\" />\r\n\r\nTooltip for when the display server doesn't support HDR output is:\r\n> Try changing the display/display_server/driver\r\n> advanced project setting to a display server\r\n> that supports HDR output.\"\r\n\r\nI believe this resolves all outstanding comments.\r\n\r\nEdit: hmm, maybe I should write “Change…” and “Move…” instead of “Try changing…” and “Try moving…”","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4193348874/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote