/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4194382561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4238165575","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118079#issuecomment-4238165575","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118079","id":4238165575,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78nUZH","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-13T16:54:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T16:54:58Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4238165575/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451340869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118079#issuecomment-4451340869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118079","id":4451340869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCVISRQ","user":{"login":"DySeath","id":60539450,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTM5NDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60539450?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath","html_url":"https://github.com/DySeath","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DySeath/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T13:59:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T13:59:46Z","body":"> By moving the game window pop-up menu to a three dots icon, [the issue demonstrated in this stream](https://www.twitch.tv/jotson/clip/DepressedLongDonutSwiftRage-EB06N4p79C4-TClM) should be resolved, or at least mitigated until a better and more substantial change has been implemented. Placing this three dots icon next to the game window size label should be an intuitive location to find game window options, such as the embedded window sizing.\r\n\r\nI don't think it mitigates the issue shown in this stream and, in fact, makes it harder to discover in some cases.\r\n\r\nAssuming I'm not missing something obvious:\r\nIn the editor, the \"window size label\" is not visible. When running the game in non-embedded mode, it is not visible either because you would be focusing on the extracted game and not on the game tab in the editor.\r\nIt seems to be the case for the streamer you've shared since both \"Embed Game on Next Play\" and \"Make Game Workspace Floating on Next Play\" are disabled in the stream segment you've shared when he finally finds the setting.\r\n\r\nRunning the game in non-embed mode seems necessary when you want to record only the game. For example, I'm not a streamer but I make a short recording every day for my teammates with OBS, so I have to deactivate it.\r\n\r\nI think for this use case, the three dots in the far right corner looks like settings for this part of the editor UI, instead of other settings for the game view itself, since they are separated from other game view settings.\r\n\r\nI think the issue can be mitigated by aligning both window size and the three dots on the left with other game view settings.\r\n\r\nI agree this issue will be solved if this proposal (https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14445) is implemented but for the time being it seems a usability regression to me.\r\n\r\nFor context I've tested in both 4.7 beta1 and 4.7 beta2.\r\n\r\nI hope this message is clear enough and it helps. Thank you for your work. It is still very much appreciated.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451340869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658877370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118079#issuecomment-4658877370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118079","id":4658877370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFbDTug","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T10:32:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T10:33:38Z","body":"Now that we've entered RC stage, and neither #118664 nor an implementation of [godot-proposals/#14491](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14491) are making it to 4.7, would it be acceptable to revert the position and icon of the embedded window options back to the left side? It seriously impedes discovery, and much of the options contained within will more than likely move again in a following version.\r\n\r\nI'm also unsure why the HDR subsection is hidden entirely when the game isn't running...\r\n\r\n> <img width=\"424\" height=\"202\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7a24305-4ad1-43ed-a20a-376b78e6f7cc\" />\r\n\r\nIsn't this really bad for discovery of this new feature too?\r\n\r\nCan the HDR options not become persistently visible and remain here, while the rest of the options be restored to their original location/icon, pending planned improvements?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658877370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]